        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "In the end, I've decided to document how to do the custom mapping. Mostly because I do want 'mini.basics' mappings to be as consistent as possible (and not trigger mode change) while there is already a section for custom remaps in `:h MiniMap.gen_integration.builtin_search()`.\r\n\r\nThis should now be documented on latest `main`.",
